# icloud: iCloud page. Check in each look.
# Never type a real Apple ID or password; never click "Sign in" or "Open account.apple.com".
ipc panels settings icloud
wait 2
shot ic-top
note I1: "iCloud account" with rows 1.-3. and "Sign in to iCloud" (button greyed), plus the keyring row if the arena has no keyring; same texts and footer as QML.
# MANUAL: I2 click the "2. Apple ID" field, type x: placeholder hides on focus, accent border (Glass) / primary outline (Material); Sign in stays greyed (password empty). BackSpace, Esc.
# MANUAL: I3 glide over "Open account.apple.com" and "Sign in": same hover/disabled look as QML.
# MANUAL: I4 type x in Apple ID, go to another page and back: field empty (Rust must match).
ipc panels close
